// Copy to Secrets.xcconfig (gitignored) and fill in REVERSED_CLIENT_ID from
// the real GoogleService-Info.plist once the iOS app is registered in
// Firebase (see CLAUDE.md's ios/ section) — Info.plist's CFBundleURLTypes
// needs this as a build setting since Xcode's plist variable substitution
// can't read another plist file directly. Unlike Android, iOS's Google
// Sign-In flow (GoogleSignIn-iOS) uses the iOS app's own OAuth client
// (GoogleService-Info.plist's CLIENT_ID, read automatically via
// FirebaseApp.app()?.options.clientID) rather than a separate "web client
// id" — so there's no GOOGLE_WEB_CLIENT_ID equivalent needed here.
REVERSED_CLIENT_ID =
